# 🔐 ADMIN PIN SECURITY SYSTEM
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Features:
#   1. PIN is hashed in memory — never compared as plaintext
#   2. Failed-attempt rate limiter — 3 wrong PINs in 10 min = 30 min lockout
#   3. Bot Owner DM alerts on EVERY admin attempt (success or failure)
#   4. Optional dedicated security log channel
#   5. /admin_rotate_pin to change the PIN without restarting
