#  SCOPE NOTE: youtube.readonly is enough to LIST and ANNOUNCE videos, which
#  is what "release all games that I stream" needs. If you ever want the bot
#  to UPLOAD, swap to .../auth/youtube.upload and redo step 5 — but know that
